"Temperature shows the hottest drive; Wear shows the most-worn drive; Health shows a colored dot for the worst drive. When off, only the NVMeter icon is shown." = "「温度」显示最热的盘；「磨损」显示磨损最高的盘；「健康」用彩色圆点显示状态最差的盘。关闭后只显示 NVMeter 图标。";
"NVMeter — Self-Test" = "NVMeter — 硬盘自检";
