"What the extended test does" = "扩展自检做什么";
"The drive scans its entire media surface and read/verifies it, then reports pass or fail. It's the most thorough check short of a full surface scan, and it's read-only — your data is not touched. Expect minutes on a healthy NVMe SSD, longer on large or mechanical drives." = "硬盘会扫描并读取校验全部存储介质，然后报告通过或失败。这是除整盘表面扫描外最彻底的检查，且为只读——不会改动你的数据。健康的 NVMe SSD 通常几分钟完成，大容量或机械硬盘则更久。";
