"Warranty length is the manufacturer's rated term; remaining coverage also depends on your purchase date. NVMeter never sends your serial anywhere." = "质保年限是厂商标称的期限；实际剩余保修还取决于你的购买日期。NVMeter 不会把你的序列号发往任何地方。";
"Opens the manufacturer's official warranty page and copies this drive's serial number to your clipboard to paste in. NVMeter itself sends nothing — the request comes from your browser." = "打开厂商官方质保页面，并把这块盘的序列号复制到剪贴板供你粘贴。NVMeter 本身不发送任何内容——请求由你的浏览器发起。";
"Warranty info" = "质保说明";
"Opens the manufacturer's serial-number warranty checker and copies this drive's serial to your clipboard to paste in. NVMeter itself sends nothing — the request comes from your browser." = "打开厂商的序列号质保查询页，并把这块盘的序列号复制到剪贴板供你粘贴。NVMeter 本身不发送任何内容——请求由你的浏览器发起。";
"This brand has no online serial-number lookup — opens its warranty-policy page instead. Coverage is the rated term above, counted from your purchase date; keep your receipt. NVMeter sends nothing." = "该品牌没有在线序列号查询——改为打开其质保政策页。保修期为上方标称年限，自购买日起算，请保留购买凭证。NVMeter 不发送任何内容。";
"Opens Apple's coverage checker and copies your Mac's serial number to the clipboard — Apple covers the built-in SSD under the whole machine, not by drive serial. NVMeter sends nothing." = "打开 Apple 的保修状态查询页，并把你 Mac 的整机序列号复制到剪贴板——Apple 按整机保修内置 SSD，而非按硬盘序列号。NVMeter 不发送任何内容。";

